Aspartame downstream delta for sugar, rebased onto Sugar PR #1106 at
beaae56c23acab8781525319d4da2884082ab0e7 (2026-10-22).

Generated from the verified guest preview checkout (October 5 build plus
0058, 0112z and 0203), rebased onto the new upstream head. It folds every
patch now kept for provenance under patches/gtk4-preview/folded/. It also
converts src/jarabe/main.py and src/jarabe/frame/framewindow.py back to LF:
upstream commits 9103057/beaae56 accidentally introduced CRLF line endings.
Regenerate with scripts/sugar-gtk4-rebase.sh; never hand-edit hunks.

